WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.867 --> 00:00:21.053
Sarah: I can't believe Mittens is gone!

2
00:00:21.054 --> 00:00:23.152
Riley: Don't worry, Sarah.

3
00:00:23.153 --> 00:00:26.200
We'll find her.

4
00:00:26.201 --> 00:00:29.606
Sarah's Mom: She has to be here somewhere.

5
00:00:29.607 --> 00:00:37.100
Sarah: She could be alone and scared!

6
00:00:37.101 --> 00:00:40.781
Theo: Mittens, where are you?

7
00:00:40.782 --> 00:00:48.348
Skyler: Here, kitty, kitty!

8
00:00:48.349 --> 00:00:51.752
Ben: Did you hear that?

9
00:00:51.753 --> 00:00:53.990
Skyler: Hear what?

10
00:00:53.991 --> 00:00:57.762
Ben: A cat meowing!

11
00:00:57.763 --> 00:01:00.293
Chatter: Meow, meow!

12
00:01:00.294 --> 00:01:03.782
Skyler: Quiet, Chatter. Listen.

13
00:01:03.783 --> 00:01:06.223
Sarah: I heard it again!

14
00:01:06.224 --> 00:01:11.739
Riley: So did I!

15
00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:15.392
Theo: There's a cat around here somewhere.

16
00:01:15.393 --> 00:01:16.858
Sarah: There it is!

17
00:01:16.859 --> 00:01:18.852
It's a kitten!

18
00:01:18.853 --> 00:01:23.882
Kitten: Meow! Meow!

19
00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:27.402
Sarah's Mom: What a cute kitten!

20
00:01:27.403 --> 00:01:30.871
Ben: I wonder where it came from.

21
00:01:30.872 --> 00:01:34.329
Sarah: It's very friendly!

22
00:01:34.330 --> 00:01:38.596
Theo: Maybe the magician did a super magic trick.

23
00:01:38.597 --> 00:01:43.270
Riley: And turned Mittens into a real kitten!

24
00:01:43.271 --> 00:01:45.973
Sarah: Really?

25
00:01:45.974 --> 00:01:49.751
Ben: I don't think a magician could do that.

26
00:01:49.752 --> 00:01:52.030
Chatter: Meow! Meow!

27
00:01:52.031 --> 00:01:56.126
Riley: Look! Chatter found Mittens.

28
00:01:56.127 --> 00:02:02.276
Skyler: She fell behind the stage.

29
00:02:02.277 --> 00:02:07.127
Sarah: Oh, Mittens, I'm so glad you're okay!

30
00:02:07.128 --> 00:02:12.520
Sarah's Mom: Whew! What a relief!

31
00:02:12.521 --> 00:02:15.091
Sarah: I'm so happy to see her.

32
00:02:15.092 --> 00:02:18.318
But I love this little kitten too!

33
00:02:18.319 --> 00:02:22.425
Riley: The kitten likes you too, Sarah.

34
00:02:22.426 --> 00:02:25.444
Sarah: Mom, can I keep it?

35
00:02:25.445 --> 00:02:28.485
Then I could have a real, live pet.

36
00:02:28.486 --> 00:02:31.059
Sarah's Mom: I don't know, Sarah.

37
00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:39.471
First we have to find its owner.
